# The build context of rust/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore instead of the
# repository root's .dockerignore, which leaves rust/ out of the Python image): the Rust
# workspace without its build output and test runs, and the static files the binary embeds.
*
!rust/
rust/target/
rust/tests/runs/
rust/**/__pycache__/
rust/Dockerfile*
rust/radius/
!netportal/static/
